\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\f0\fs24 Council Member Mansfield requested the City take action to help Downtown businesses who are suffering during the summer season's low foot traffic. \par
\par
Council Member Hilty spoke on the nationwide trend of low sales for small businesses during the summer season. He discussed how retail is disappearing, due to the high increase of incoming restaurants/bars.\par
\par
City Manager Pete Lee spoke on increasing housing opportunities Downtown to increase foot traffic for local businesses. Downtown businesses will experience decreased foot traffic during the summer season, due to construction. \par
\f1\par
}

