\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\f0\fs24 Sarah Suskey, The Advocacy Partners, discussed the 2025 Legislative Session. Governor Ron DeSantis approved a $115 billion budget for the State of Florida and vetoed $600 million worth of projects. The Advocacy Partners will meet with the City\rquote s leadership in September, to discuss priorities for next year. Next year\rquote s 2026 Legislative Session will be the last session for Governor Ron DeSantis, Senate President Ben Albritton, and House Representative Daniel Perez; terms ending in year 2027. The Advocacy Partners anticipate next year\rquote s session will address the following issues: property tax reform, sales tax reform, and property insurance. \par
\f1\par
}

