\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\f0\fs24 City Clerk Angel Jacobs announced the ballot vote results, confirming that City Council has appointed Thad Boyd to the Airport Advisory Board. The appointment is for a new four-year term, which is set to expire on April 7, 2030.\f1\par
}

