\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\f0\fs24 Police Chief Balken reported that overall incidents increased slightly by 0.5% to 762 calls, with proactive calls decreasing 6% and dispatch calls rising 13% to more than 2,800. Arrests increased from 267 to 316, while other detentions declined from 224 to 179. Traffic stops rose significantly by 26% to over 1,000, and the city\rquote s crash rate decreased by about 9%. \par
\par
}

