\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\f0\fs24 Mayor Marciano said his office will focus on addressing synthetic kratom, working with the Attorney General\rquote s Office and releasing educational videos about its harmful effects. He asked the Council to consider an ordinance similar to one discussed by the County Commission that would restrict new smoke shops from opening near schools, childcare centers, and similar facilities. He emphasized concerns about the growing number of smoke shops and their impact on the community, noting resident feedback that synthetic kratom is being used as a drug substitute. He said he and the police chief will work together on solutions to reduce bad actors and protect residents. Council agreed to have staff research the idea and bring back options.\par
\par
}

